        1241,
        1840
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "mend and the Mayor shall appoint an Executive Director of Financial Information Services to implement and carry out the functions of the Agency under the direction and supervision of the directors. The Agency shall employ such other officers and employees as may be required to perform its duties within the appropriation therefor.",
